endustai diri sendiri, yakni sebagai membenci bau busuk dan menyukai keelokan. Inilah yang dinamai bahagia di dalam diri sejati. Maka seorang Junzi - Kuncu sangat hati-hati pada waktu seorang diri."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.07.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"xiǎo","traditional":"小","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"闲","pinyin":"xián","traditional":"閒","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jū","traditional":"居","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shàn","traditional":"善","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"至","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"见","pinyin":"jiàn","traditional":"見","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"后","pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"後","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"厌","pinyin":"yàn","traditional":"厭","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rán","traditional":"然","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"yǎn","traditional":"揜","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shàn","traditional":"善","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"着","pinyin":"zhù","traditional":"著","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shàn","traditional":"善","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"视","pinyin":"shì","traditional":"視","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jǐ","traditional":"己","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"rú","traditional":"如","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"见","pinyin":"jiàn","traditional":"見","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fèi","traditional":"肺","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"gān","traditional":"肝","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rán","traditional":"然","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"则","pinyin":"zé","traditional":"則","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hé","traditional":"何","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yì","traditional":"益","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"矣","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"cǐ","traditional":"此","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"谓","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"謂","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"诚","pinyin":"chéng","traditional":"誠","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"于","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"於","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhōng","traditional":"中","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"xíng","traditional":"形","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"于","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"於","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wài","traditional":"外","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bì","traditional":"必","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shèn","traditional":"慎","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"独","pinyin":"dú","traditional":"獨","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Seorang rendah budi (Siau Jien) pada saat terluang dan menyendiri suka berbuat hal-hal yang tidak baik dengan tanpa mengenal batas. Bila saat itu terlihat oleh seorang Junzi - Kuncu, ia mencoba menyembunyikan perbuatannya yang tidak baik itu dan berusaha memperlihatkan kebaikannya. Tetapi bila orang mau memperhatikannya baik-baik, niscaya dapat melihat terang isi hati dan perutnya. Maka apakah gunanya perbuatan palsu itu? Inilah yang dinamai Iman yang di dalam itu akan nampak meraga di luar. Maka seorang Junzi - Kuncu sangat hati-hati pada waktu seorang diri. (Shu Jing - Su King IV.3.3)."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.07.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"céng","traditional":"曾","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"shí","traditional":"十","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mù","traditional":"目","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"视","pinyin":"shì","traditional":"視","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"shí","traditional":"十","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shǒu","traditional":"手","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhǐ","traditional":"指","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"严","pinyin":"yán","traditional":"嚴","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hū","traditional":"乎","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"！”"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Zengzi - Cingcu berkata, \"Sepuluh mata melihat sepuluh tangan menunjuk, tidakkah itu menakutkan?\""},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.07.04","number":4,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"fù","traditional":"富","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"润","pinyin":"rùn","traditional":"潤","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wū","traditional":"屋","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"润","pinyin":"rùn","traditional":"潤","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shēn","traditional":"身","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"xīn","traditional":"心","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"广","pinyin":"guǎng","traditional":"廣","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"体","pinyin":"tǐ","traditional":"體","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"pàng","traditional":"胖","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bì","traditional":"必","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"诚","pinyin":"chéng","traditional":"誠","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yì","traditional":"意","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Harta benda dapat menghias rumah, laku bajik menghias diri; hati yang lapang itu akan membawa tubuh kita sehat. Maka seorang Junzi - Kuncu senantiasa mengimankan tekadnya. (Bc. VIIA: 21. 4)."}],"source_file":"01 - Da Xue 大學/07 - Bab VI - Mengimankan Tekad.md","title":"Bab VI — Mengimankan Tekad"}